{"2674650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FUR Squadron Phoenix", "steam_appid": 2674650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4432860], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get ready for <strong>Update 2.0</strong>, featuring <strong>an all‑new story campaign with Full Range Combat missions</strong>. Experience the action and gameplay of FUR Squadron Phoenix as never before and finish the fight. This update adds to the main roguelite campaign and the features included in previous updates, such as the <strong>Advanced Run</strong> (exclusive to expert pilots) and <strong>Boss Challenges</strong>.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/ac3122fa41e7c4cae2b21cd426bdbf31.poster.avif?t=1787729533\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/ac3122fa41e7c4cae2b21cd426bdbf31.webm?t=1787729533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/ac3122fa41e7c4cae2b21cd426bdbf31.mp4?t=1787729533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>roguelite on-rail levels with unlockable abilities and stat upgrades</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Showcasing intricate, dynamic, and captivating landscapes and environments. <strong>Huge bosses and fleets of enemy ships, on space, air and sea</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shiny new weapons, offering more than just conventional guided projectiles. Get ready to <strong>wield a colossal power beam, multi-missile barrages, and a powerful nuke strike!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your teammates challenges and unlock conversations and upgrades for the <strong>devastating Overdrive power-up</strong>. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/9d66df33847b6bbb168e4adc5675b227.poster.avif?t=1787729533\" width=560 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/9d66df33847b6bbb168e4adc5675b227.webm?t=1787729533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/9d66df33847b6bbb168e4adc5675b227.mp4?t=1787729533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Mode</strong> and <strong>Boss Rush</strong> challenges for experienced players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new campaign featuring Full Range Combat gameplay </strong>and an epilogue storyline to the main campaign's quest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.poster.avif?t=1787729533\" width=560 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.webm?t=1787729533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.mp4?t=1787729533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>“War drums are beating at the Bist System. Alarmed by the increasing activity of the dangerous Marauders, the Chimera Federation has decided to reinforce the troops of its space fleet. A brave and determined recruit is sent to the renegade FUR Squadron for special training using their virtual reality technology. Will they manage to hone their skills before it’s too late?”</i> before it's too late?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get ready for <strong>Update 2.0</strong>, featuring <strong>an all‑new story campaign with Full Range Combat missions</strong>. Experience the action and gameplay of FUR Squadron Phoenix as never before and finish the fight. This update adds to the main roguelite campaign and the features included in previous updates, such as the <strong>Advanced Run</strong> (exclusive to expert pilots) and <strong>Boss Challenges</strong>.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/ac3122fa41e7c4cae2b21cd426bdbf31.poster.avif?t=1787729533\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/ac3122fa41e7c4cae2b21cd426bdbf31.webm?t=1787729533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/ac3122fa41e7c4cae2b21cd426bdbf31.mp4?t=1787729533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>roguelite on-rail levels with unlockable abilities and stat upgrades</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Showcasing intricate, dynamic, and captivating landscapes and environments. <strong>Huge bosses and fleets of enemy ships, on space, air and sea</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shiny new weapons, offering more than just conventional guided projectiles. Get ready to <strong>wield a colossal power beam, multi-missile barrages, and a powerful nuke strike!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your teammates challenges and unlock conversations and upgrades for the <strong>devastating Overdrive power-up</strong>. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/9d66df33847b6bbb168e4adc5675b227.poster.avif?t=1787729533\" width=560 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/9d66df33847b6bbb168e4adc5675b227.webm?t=1787729533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/9d66df33847b6bbb168e4adc5675b227.mp4?t=1787729533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Mode</strong> and <strong>Boss Rush</strong> challenges for experienced players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new campaign featuring Full Range Combat gameplay </strong>and an epilogue storyline to the main campaign's quest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.poster.avif?t=1787729533\" width=560 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.webm?t=1787729533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.mp4?t=1787729533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>“War drums are beating at the Bist System. Alarmed by the increasing activity of the dangerous Marauders, the Chimera Federation has decided to reinforce the troops of its space fleet. A brave and determined recruit is sent to the renegade FUR Squadron for special training using their virtual reality technology. Will they manage to hone their skills before it’s too late?”</i> before it's too late?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Embark on an action-packed adventure in this on-rails space shooter. As a pilot in training, you’ll battle in strange virtual worlds. Master your ship, upgrade your skills, and protect the federation from an imminent threat. Are you ready for the challenge?", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, French, German, Japanese", "reviews": "“the Star Fox 64 successor I've wanted for nearly three decades”<br>8.5 – Game Informer<br><br>“I can’t wait to see what this developer does next”<br>8 – Nintendo World Report<br><br>“Fur Real, This Feels Like Star Fox!”<br>ThunderStash Gaming<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/348697cf57dce99486b121dd74a5659ff8be265c/header.jpg?t=1787729533", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/2171d92d0523b942a672a5a7747174a2f8ab6072/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787729533", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/2171d92d0523b942a672a5a7747174a2f8ab6072/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787729533", "website": "https://www.raptorclawapps.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10